{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-01-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'AEP NAMES GRANATA VICE PRESIDENT OF SAFETY AND HEALTH', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) HAS NAMED MICHAEL GRANATA, VICE PRESIDENT, SAFETY & HEALTH, EFFECTIVE FEB. 5. HE WILL REPORT TO LISA BARTON, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER.'}